        {
          "text": ", "
        },
        {
          "text": "3+6",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and "
        },
        {
          "text": "6+3",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": ": three different things, not one thing turned around. Measured from the bass on strings 1-2-3, that's three different shapes:"
